}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I paid Acme Supplies's approved invoice by wire.\n\n- **Invoice:** INV-63450 (vendor V-232)\n- **Amount:** $6,896.22, paid in full\n- **Payment ID:** PAY0001\n- **Rail:** Wire, status \"sent\"\n\nThe vendor has wire enabled and bank details verified, so ACH wasn't needed. The amount is under the $10,000 threshold, so no controller approval was required. I sent the wire once, with an idempotency key, so it can't be duplicated.\n\nAcme's other invoices were left alone: INV-47800 ($7,314.58) is still a draft awaiting approval, and INV-91954 was already paid.", "type": "text"}]}]}